        "Local two phase heat transfer coefficient of straight pipe | horizontal or vertical boiling | horizontal condensation"
        extends Modelica.Icons.Function;
        //SOURCE_1: Bejan,A.: HEAT TRANSFER HANDBOOK, Wiley, 2003.
